  <div class="wrap thesis-grid">
    <h2 id="thesis-h" class="display thesis-line">Age-based bans regulate who can access social media, not how it is designed.</h2>
    <div class="thesis-side">
      <div class="split" aria-hidden="true">
        <p><span class="split-k">Who</span><span class="split-v">Regulated</span></p>
        <p class="off"><span class="split-k">How</span><span class="split-v">Largely not</span></p>
